---
source: src/main_tests.rs
expression: help
---
Search using a caller-provided Codex access token. Reads web.run JSON from stdin unless --query is provided.

Usage: codex-web-search [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --auth-file <AUTH_FILE>
          Read tokens from this Codex auth.json instead of CODEX_ACCESS_TOKEN
          
          [env: CODEX_AUTH_FILE=]

      --account-id <ACCOUNT_ID>
          Optional workspace routing hint; otherwise read from the token/auth file
          
          [env: CHATGPT_ACCOUNT_ID=]

      --query <QUERY>
          Search a single query instead of reading command JSON from stdin

      --session-id <SESSION_ID>
          Reuse this ID when opening a search result from an earlier invocation

      --model <MODEL>
          [default: gpt-6-astra]

      --mode <MODE>
          [default: live]
          [possible values: live, cached, indexed]

      --max-output-tokens <MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS>
          [default: 10000]

      --base-url <BASE_URL>
          [default: https://chatgpt.com/backend-api/codex/]

  -h, --help
          Print help
